{"schemaVersion": "svg-plan-ledger-v1", "source": {"exam": "archive/exams/similar/high/h1/1final/25_강남여고_1학기_기말_고1_유사1.js", "sourceOrdinal": 24, "sourceId": 24, "uid": null, "sourceCommit": "9fbcf190fd8abaa03f330def331afc7c7c27ba60", "sourceBlobSha": "7a8483e1cafae7e27832fe47a2da008524501152"}, "scope": "similar", "existing": {"inventoryStatus": "INVENTORIED", "problemAssets": [], "solutionAssets": [], "productionLedgerState": null, "checkedCommit": "9fbcf190fd8abaa03f330def331afc7c7c27ba60", "visualReview": "NO_LINKED_ASSETS", "missingAssets": []}, "need": {"problem": "NOT_REQUIRED", "solution": "EXEMPT", "why": "A²=A-E를 벡터 등식에 적용한다."}, "plan": {"decisionPath": "docs/plans/archive-one-route-upgrade/svg-plans-expanded/similar/high/h1/1final/25_강남여고_1학기_기말_고1_유사1/_decisions.jsonl", "files": [], "capability": null, "status": "NOT_STARTED", "render": "NOT_RUN"}, "pedagogy": {"decisiveRelation": "A²=A-E를 벡터 등식에 적용한다.", "auxiliaryLines": [], "intermediateValues": [], "correspondingMarks": [], "hiddenAnswerValues": ["-16"], "sourceEvidence": "이차정사각행렬 $A$가 $A^2 - A + E = O$를 만족시키고, $A \\begin{pmatrix} -1 \\\\ 2 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 4 \\\\ 5 \\end{pmatrix}$일 때, 행렬 $A^2 \\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\\\ -4 \\end{pmatrix}$의 모든 성분의 합을 구하시오. (단, $E$는 단위행렬, $O$는 영행렬이다.)"}, "checks": {"answerHidden": null, "midValuesKept": null, "coordsVerified": null, "captionNamesPresent": null, "visualReviewed": false}, "publication": {"state": "UNVERIFIED", "evidence": null}}
